LIBRARY          ARITH2
DESCRIPTION      'Mental arithmetic activities generator for CLIC 2.0'
EXETYPE          WINDOWS

CODE             PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA             PRELOAD MOVEABLE SINGLE

HEAPSIZE         5120
STACKSIZE        2048

EXPORTS
  WEP                 @1   RESIDENTNAME
  GetClicDllVer       @2
  RemakeAct           @3
  ConfigureDllOptions @4
  IsValidAct          @5
